            <value>At 11:55 a.m. Central Standard Time Sunday, Environment Canada has ended a tornado warning for South Central and Southeastern Saskatchewan.  Lanigan, Jansen, Semans, Duval, Govan, Nokomis, Strasbourg, Rowans Ravine Park, Earl Grey, Silton, Lumsden, Regina Beach, Craven, Wynyard, Elfros, Foam Lake, Ituna, Lestock, Wishart, Punnichy and Raymore.  </value>
        </parameter>
        <parameter>
